{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/922227-wraith-blue-book-or-limited-line","id":922227,"title":"Wraith: Blue Book or limited line?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-06-27T14:43:47-07:00","id":922227,"title":"Wraith: Blue Book or limited line?","content":"Wraith seem less powerful than the Major Templates and had a Blue Book with the Dark Eras as a line of the year. Especially if Geist ghost earned a book inside the line, you do not have much to work with, in addition to the Core and maybe a Companion and Guide Translation, as well as rational Zombies can also make your own Blue Book.<br /> <br /> In the follow the idea of without social organizations and replicate the original idea that was abandoned Oblivion.<br /> <br /> What do you think?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/641-ben-linus","name":"Ben Linus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-28T09:38:25-07:00","id":922687,"title":"","content":"Personally I have no idea why playable and potent ghost PCs didn't show up in Giest. We know(or at least have been told) that Giest is getting a 2E, and that the Underworld will once again be defined in glorious macabre detail. This seems the best way to make a ghost game where ghosts can share the center stage. <br /> Not too fond of Wraith as a simple bluebook supplement, because the old game was so very much tied to a setting that Giest has inherited.<br /> <br /> Also, mixing ghosts and the living worked fine for Orpheus.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><br /> I draw things! Wanna check it out? Click on the link below!<br /> <a href=\"https://www.deviantart.com/jordantroy\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.deviantart.com/jordantroy</a><br /> <br /> <i><b>YES! I do commissions! </b></i>","edited":{"userid":848,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/848-jtroy","user":"JTroy","date":". 06-28-2016, 12:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/848-jtroy","name":"JTroy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar848_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"183"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-28T19:38:56-07:00","id":922998,"title":"","content":"Wraith doesn't need to be redone; the original was a masterpiece, and a CofD ghost game would forever be in its shadow. I'd rather have something unique and different like Geist than a shallow imitation of a game I already love.<br /> <br /> Now, a blue book on ghosts that expanded upon the Lucid Dead merit from Mummy and added a handful of ghost-focused Hunter groups? Sign me up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-28T23:27:04-07:00","id":923111,"title":"","content":"I'd love to have a great big old Dead Translation Guide for all the ghostly splats of WoD into a ChroD framework. Wraiths, Spooks, Risen, what have you, all put alongside the Bound. Now, I don't know that the two dead realms play well with the other's ghosts, but I'd like something a bit more tragic than Geist provides for.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>LFP: Foreign Bodies (Deviant: the Renegades)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/969-verge","name":"Verge","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"378"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}